"program_narrative": "Program RPTAUD00 is a batch audit report generator. It opens the indexed audit file (AUDIT-FILE, DD AUDITLOG) and error file (ERROR-FILE, DD ERRLOG) for input and the sequential report file (REPORT-FILE, DD RPTFILE) for output; if any open returns a file status other than '00' it displays an error message, sets return code 12 and ends. It then writes three header lines to the report: a line of asterisks, the title 'SYSTEM AUDIT REPORT' and 'REPORT DATE:' with the system date. The audit-trail processing (read and summarise audit records), error-log processing (read and summarise error records) and summary writing (audit, error and control summaries) are delegated to seven paragraphs that are not present in the source, so the report body cannot be traced. Finally it closes the three files and returns. The error-message field WS-ERROR-MESSAGE and the FDs for AUDIT-FILE and ERROR-FILE are not declared in the source.",
